<title>THAILAND: Siam Pulp third quarter net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Siam Pulp third quarter net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for the first nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 1.55			2.17</p>
<p>    Net			241.79		    300.06</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 2.69     vs	     5.83</p>
<p>    Net			394.40     vs	   801.31</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Siam Pulp and Paper Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
